{"id":"nan-madol","name":"Nan Madol","qid":"Q846967","country":"Federated States of Micronesia","locality":"Madolenihmw","lat":"6.841944","lon":"158.332222","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Date not recorded","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"World Heritage Site; National Register of Historic Places listed place; National Historic Landmark","type":"ruins; archaeological site; artificial island","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nan_Madol","text":"Nan Madol is an archaeological site adjacent to the eastern shore of the island of Pohnpei, now part of the Madolenihmw district of Pohnpei state in the Federated States of Micronesia in the western Pacific Ocean. Nan Madol was the capital of the Saudeleur dynasty until about 1628. The city, constructed in a lagoon, consists of a series of small artificial islands linked by a network of canals.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nan_Madol","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[{"id":"gh-f70f2b1f95c4","w":1200,"h":787,"title":"Nan madol.jpg","o":"gh-f70f2b1f95c4.jpg","credit":{"text":"NOAA","license":"Public domain","license_url":"","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nan_madol.jpg","via":"Wikimedia Commons"}}],"depictions":[{"id":"civilization-vii--nan-madol","game":"civilization-vii","name":"Nan Madol","verified":false,"text":"is a city-state and wonder in the Civilization games.","text_source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/Nan_Madol","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-530f01b951f6","w":800,"h":800,"o":"gh-530f01b951f6.webp","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VII, © 2K.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Feudalism_(Civ7).png","via":"Fandom (civilization)","note":"Fandom upload by Jostriker on 2025-11-22"}},{"id":"gh-p97bd68f8ee5","w":1200,"h":675,"o":"gh-p97bd68f8ee5.png","credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Civilization VII, © 2K.","source":"https://civilization.fandom.com/wiki/File:Nan_Madol_in-ga